# Mobile Platform Overview

This page explains **the tools we use to build, test, release, and monitor mobile apps**. For each tool, you will learn what it does and when to use it.

To install your development tools, follow [Machine Setup](./machine-setup-guide/index.mdx).

> **Confidential — internal use only.** Keep enterprise source, configuration, internal links, and operational evidence within approved systems. Never share credentials, signing material, personal data, or sensitive logs in documentation, screenshots, support messages, or AI prompts.

## Tech Stack Selection

Your **tech stack** is the set of languages, frameworks, and tools you use to build the app. If you’re joining an existing app, use its stack and the tool versions in its repository. For a new app, **start with React Native as the preferred choice**. Review platform-specific requirements with your team before choosing a native stack.

